---
title: Movie Corner
description: Movie takes and whatever Nick's been watching lately.
---

<p>Hot takes and whatever I've been watching lately.</p>

<h2>Recently Watched</h2>

{% if letterboxd.films.length %}
<ul class="watch-log">
{%- for film in letterboxd.films %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ film.url }}"><cite>{{ film.title }}</cite>{% if film.year %} ({{ film.year }}){% endif %}</a>
    {%- if film.rating %} <span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">{{ film.rating | stars }}</span><span class="visually-hidden">, {{ film.rating }} out of 5 stars</span>{% endif %}
    {%- if film.liked %} <span class="liked" aria-hidden="true">♥</span><span class="visually-hidden">, liked</span>{% endif %}
    {%- if film.rewatch %} <span class="tag">rewatch</span>{% endif %}
    <span class="watched">&middot; <time datetime="{{ film.watched }}">{{ film.watched | readableDate }}</time></span>
    {%- if film.review %}
    <q class="review">{{ film.review }}</q>
    {%- endif %}
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

<p class="small">From my <a href="https://letterboxd.com/thenickatnite/">Letterboxd diary</a>.</p>
{% else %}
<p>The projector's broken. Catch my diary on <a href="https://letterboxd.com/thenickatnite/">Letterboxd</a> instead.</p>
{% endif %}
